From fec51cf27336e016547829ca37f7c03f33e7d8f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerege Systems Development Team <dev@gerege.mn>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 09:57:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat(kernel): Host contract + move
 gspace/integrations/core-find wiring into modules/

Phase 1 continuation: kernel/module gains the runtime contract - Host
(APIRouter/Pool/AuthMiddleware + shared-service locator) and Module
(ID/Register). Three reference modules now assemble their own
repo -> usecase -> route wiring in modules/<id>/module.go; server.go no
longer knows their internals. Golden route inventory is byte-identical,
proving the extraction changed no behaviour. Remaining modules migrate
one by one along this pattern.
